        "filing_date": "2025-12-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our development efforts, we seek to develop products that support network operators as they pursue new business models and optimize their network performance and economics, and address a range of consumption models for networking solutions.",
