        "filing_date": "2025-12-12",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To complement our Platform Software portfolio, we offer a range of related services that include software subscription services, consulting, network migration and integration, installation and upgrade support services, and technical support relating to our Platform Software offerings.",
